# iOS/macOS MEMD Client

User-mode client for the MEMD kernel extension on Apple platforms.

## Building

```sh
make
# or manually:
clang -Wall -O2 -I. -o memd_client memd_client.c
```

## Usage

```sh
./memd_client [process_name]
```

## Files

- `client.h` — macOS/iOS ioctl wrapper (MEMD_DEVICE_PATH)
- `memd_client.c` — Example client program
- `Makefile` — Build script (Clang/Xcode)

## Notes

- Requires the MEMD kernel extension to be loaded.
- The kernel extension itself (kext) is not yet implemented.
- IOCTL codes use _IOWR with magic 'W'.

